# Next.js App Router

{{#if parameters.serverComponentsDefault}}
- Default to Server Components; add `"use client"` only when needed
{{/if}}
- Place pages in `app/` directory with `page.tsx` and `layout.tsx`
- Use `loading.tsx` and `error.tsx` for route-level states
- Fetch data in Server Components, not in useEffect
- Use `next/image` for all images
{{#if parameters.useTailwind}}
- Style with Tailwind CSS utility classes
{{/if}}
